{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はバースデーライブ\n神宮ライブ2日目でした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バースデーライブでは、\n全曲披露するんですが\n今日で半分以上おわったよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっという間！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー、さみしい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始まる前は112曲！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やばい！！って思ってたけど\nはじまってみたらあっという間で\nびっくり！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が存在しない乃木坂の時代から\n私が存在する乃木坂の時代！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その5年間の楽曲を\n3日間で披露する"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかいろいろ考えます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー！とにかく\n明日は私は後悔ないように\nこの夏に培ったたくさんのことを\n全部表現できるようにがんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わりたくない！今年の夏！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもの夏と違ったんだ！\nだから、ずっとこの夏を\n過ごしたい！味わってたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、そうはしてられないし\n乃木坂はどんどん坂を登っていきます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、私も乃木坂から離れないように\n乃木坂を引っ張っていけるように\n坂をぐんぐん登ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたのステージからみえる景色\n思うことはどんななんだろう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/29/8211033/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/29/8211033/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆかた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/29/8211033/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、今日はこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そいえば、ヒナセレをだいぶやってなかったのでツアーが終わって落ち着いたら\nまたやるねっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/29/8211033/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさいー！！！"}],"source":"archive"}